A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and companies known as liica Inc developed the app '''Pachi-Slot Nyanko Daisensou BIGBANG''' (ぱちスロ にゃんこ大戦争BIGBANG, ''Pachi Suro Nyanko Daisensō BIGBANG'', '''Pachi-Slot Nyanko Daisensou BIGBANG''') and Kyoraku manufactured pachinko machines related to the app is an ongoing collaboration that arrived on June 5th, 2023.<br>

